%N A400214 Semiprimes in A399741.
%C A400214 Includes 3*p for p > 2 in A401453.
%C A400214 a(k) is a term if and only if (a(k+1) - a(k) + sqrt((a(k+1) - a(k))^2 - 4*a(k)))/2 and (a(k+1) - a(k) - sqrt((a(k+1)-a(k))^2 - 4*a(k)))/2 are primes.
%H A400214 Robert Israel, <a href="/A400214/b400214.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..584</a>
%e A400214 a(4) = 287 is a term because 287 = A399741(9) = 7 * 41.
%p A400214 f:= proc(n) local F; F:= NumberTheory:-PrimeFactors(n); n + max(F) + min(F) end proc:
%p A400214 r:= 4: R:= 2:
%p A400214 for n from 3 to 100 do r:= f(r); if NumberTheory:-Omega(r)=2 then R:= R, r fi od:
%p A400214 R;
%Y A400214 Cf. A001358, A399741, A401453.
%K A400214 nonn,new
%O A400214 1,1
